  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Inside Wan clan’s immortal battlefield trap against Suan Bu Jin he offers capture and side switching if Fang Yuan exposes Fang clan. His body is covered with light armor that emits extremely high heat and buzzing noise, so his appearance cannot be seen.",
      "chapters": [
        1799
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_wan_clan",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "fac_fang_clan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "His whole body is covered with thick light armor that emits extremely high heat and buzzing noises, so his appearance cannot be seen.",
      "chapters": [
        1799
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "He kills his way through Fang Yuan’s soul beast army at high speed, showing light path superiority, while Wan Liang Han and Wan Xiao protect him. He is shocked when four immemorial soul beasts appear at the center.",
      "chapters": [
        1799
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "light-path-charge",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_wan_liang_han",
        "char_wan_xiao"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Nearest to Fang Yuan, he splits attention mid battle under distracting thoughts generation and is encircled. Wan Xiao tries to break that encirclement for him.",
      "chapters": [
        1800
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "encircled-by-distracting-thoughts",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "His armor is a killer move that will not last much longer, and he falls back to light armor Immortal Gu alone while trapped. After Wan Liang Han dies he carries the unconscious Wan Xiao and flees rather than continue a fight they cannot win.",
      "chapters": [
        1801
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "retreat",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_light_armor_gu"
      ]
    }
  ],
